@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-access-token
@memoryId = replace-with-memory-uuid

### 查询长期记忆开关：首次返回 enabled=false、version=0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/memory-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 显式启用长期记忆
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/memory-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: memory-settings-enable-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"expectedVersion":0}

### 查询本人候选和已确认记忆
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memories?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 确认模型候选
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memories/{{memoryId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: memory-confirm-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":0}

### 更正正文、清除过期时间并固定
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memories/{{memoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: memory-revise-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"我的开发环境固定使用 Windows 11 和 PowerShell 7。","expiresAt":null,"clearExpiresAt":true,"pinned":true,"expectedVersion":1}

### 撤销记忆
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memories/{{memoryId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: memory-revoke-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":2}

### 永久删除记忆
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memories/{{memoryId}}?expectedVersion=3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: memory-delete-001
